{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117181408547-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117183833\"/><p>案發中環滙豐銀行總行。</p><p>今午(17日)3時45分，中區皇后大道中滙豐銀行總行職員報案，指有兩名男女出示虛假文書以開設戶口。警員接報到場經初步調查，以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」罪，拘捕一名姓邢(52歲)本地男子及一名姓金(53歲)本地女子，並把二人帶署扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:12:50.868537+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:14:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:41.540754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:06:14.345045+00:00","content_hash":"dd167f41f4af8466e0bb3fbbc5957ecb4d32e67cad610b7c03746d5a46deb92c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:12:50.868537+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}